body:
- `dist[u] + w < dist[v]`: a **shorter** route to `v` was found, so the old routes no longer count: `dist[v]` is updated and `ways[v] = ways[u]`;
- `dist[u] + w == dist[v]`: another route of the **same** length: `ways[v] += ways[u]`;
- otherwise nothing changes.

